    F1 -.->|Loads dataset| C5
    F2 -.->|Loads results| C5
    F3 -.->|Loads model| C2
    C5 --> F5

    style USER fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0
    style SCRIPTS fill:#E8F5E9,stroke:#2E7D32
